---
description: Claim amount parsing stays canonical decimal text
alwaysApply: true
---

Any change to claim amount parsing must keep a test that `parseAmount` accepts `1,250.00` and `$1,250.00` as text `1250.00`.

That test must still reject zero, negatives, and more than two decimal places. Do not weaken those tests.

Claim creation stores the canonical decimal text from the parser.
